+'\" t
+.\"     Title: xdg-settings
+.\"    Author: Mike Mammarella
+.\" Generator: DocBook XSL Stylesheets v1.75.2 <http://docbook.sf.net/>
+.\"      Date: 07/20/2011
+.\"    Manual: xdg-settings Manual
+.\"    Source: [FIXME: source]
