+# Portions based on kdelibs KDE4Macros.cmake:
+#
+# Copyright (c) 2006, 2007, Alexander Neundorf, <neundorf@kde.org>
+# Copyright (c) 2006, 2007, Laurent Montel, <montel@kde.org>
